{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103121","id":2349266024,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6MBvRo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103121.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103121/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103121/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103121/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8df75953ec417454b6e056137d3262b7cc948bfd","number":103121,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GPU particles not emitting at some configured rates when scale curve is zero","user":{"login":"OhiraKyou","id":7255919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTU5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7255919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou","html_url":"https://github.com/OhiraKyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OhiraKyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103140\r\n\r\nThis PR re-fixes GPU particles not emitting at the configured rate when using a scale curve that starts or ends at a value of 0.\r\n\r\n### Demonstration\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41d56cdb-447d-441e-85d1-c1505eae47b5\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35c4d336-0522-48d1-b0b5-455f61159257\r\n\r\n### Explanation\r\n\r\nThe cause was the use of `sign()`, under the expectation that it would result in a value that is exclusively either `-1` or `1`. However, `sign()` returns `0` when given `0`. So, when that was multiplied by the minimum value, instead of applying the sign of the original scale (which had no sign), it just nullified the minimum value entirely. So, the whole expression did nothing at all.\r\n\r\nThis has been fixed before (see the related section in [the associated issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103140)). So, I added a descriptive comment to give this a better chance of staying fixed.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"